<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Stage 1 — Before the order</span>
<h1>Supplier Shortlisting — the buyer-side version of sourcing</h1>
<p class="lead">We find and verify candidate factories for your product. You pay a fixed fee; factories pay us nothing—which is exactly why the shortlist can be honest.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><h2>How the shortlist stays honest</h2></div></div><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/why-independent/"><h3>Fixed fee, buyer-paid</h3><p>No commission, no margin on your unit price, no success fee from factories—ever. Clause 01 &amp; 05 of the Charter.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Verified, not just listed</h3><p>Every shortlisted factory passes the same V-01 to V-10 verification we sell standalone.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/why-independent/"><h3>The firewall</h3><p>Any later inspection of a factory we shortlisted is signed by a different inspector—and we keep the written right to fail it.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>Your list, your relationships</h3><p>You get names, evidence and introductions. We never sit in the middle of your commercial terms.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><h2>How the process runs</h2></div></div><p class="prose rv">A brief call defines your product, target price band, volumes and destination-market requirements. Within ten working days you receive a shortlist of verified manufacturers—typically three to five—each with a verification summary, capacity notes, cluster context and recommended inspection plan. What happens next is your negotiation; what we sell is the confidence that everyone on the list is real. The fee is fixed and buyer-paid: from $990 for a shortlist of three verified manufacturers, plus $249 for each additional factory verified to the same standard. Factories pay us nothing, so there is no commission on top.</p></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><h2>Sourcing agent versus buyer-side shortlisting</h2></div></div><p class="prose rv">Most &ldquo;sourcing&rdquo; in India is paid by the factory: the agent earns a commission on what ships, so the incentive is to place your order, not to protect it. Supplier shortlisting inverts that. You pay a fixed fee and the factories pay nothing — no commission, no margin on your unit price, no success fee — which is the only arrangement under which a shortlist can tell you a candidate is wrong. Clause 05 of our <a href="/why-independent/">Independence Charter</a> firewalls it further: a different inspector signs any later inspection of a factory we shortlisted, and we keep the written right to fail a factory we put forward.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><h2>What the shortlist gives you</h2></div></div><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Verified manufacturers, not names</h3><p>Every factory on the shortlist has passed the same V-01 to V-10 verification we sell standalone — an unannounced premises visit, documents and export history — so &ldquo;shortlisted&rdquo; means checked, not introduced.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>The context to choose between them</h3><p>Each candidate comes with a verification summary, capacity notes and cluster context, so you are comparing real manufacturers on the factors that decide an order, not a row of quotes.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/during-production-inspection/"><h3>A recommended inspection plan</h3><p>The shortlist ends where your order begins: a recommended sequence of checks for the factory you pick, so the first PO is protected from day one.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div><h2>How the process runs and what it costs</h2></div></div><p class="prose rv">It starts with a brief call that defines your product, target price band, volumes and destination-market requirements. Within ten working days you receive a shortlist of typically three to five verified manufacturers. Pricing is fixed and buyer-paid: from $990 for three verified factories, with each additional factory at $249 — no commission, ever, and nothing charged to the factories that would compromise the verdict. If a factory we shortlisted later fails an inspection, that inspection is signed by a different inspector, and the failure stands.</p></div></section><section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><h2>Supplier shortlisting FAQ</h2></div></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details class="rv"><summary>How is this different from a sourcing agent?</summary><p>You pay a fixed fee and factories pay us nothing — no commission, no margin on your unit price and no success fee, under clauses 01 and 05 of the <a href="/why-independent/">Independence Charter</a>.</p></details>
      <details class="rv"><summary>How long does it take, and what do I receive?</summary><p>Within ten working days you receive a shortlist of typically three to five verified manufacturers, each with a verification summary, capacity notes, cluster context and a recommended inspection plan.</p></details>
      <details class="rv"><summary>Are shortlisted factories actually verified?</summary><p>Every one passes the same V-01 to V-10 verification we sell standalone as <a href="/supplier-verification-india/">supplier verification</a>.</p></details>
      <details class="rv"><summary>What if a factory you shortlisted later fails an inspection?</summary><p>Any later inspection of a factory we shortlisted is signed by a different inspector, and we keep the written right to fail it.</p></details>
      <details class="rv"><summary>What does supplier shortlisting cost?</summary><p>A fixed, buyer-paid fee from $990 for a shortlist of three verified manufacturers, plus $249 for each additional factory verified to the same V-01 to V-10 standard. Factories pay us nothing, so there is no commission on top.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
